# project: issue-to-pr
VAR remaining: number = ?

=== work_issue ===
Work the next issue from the captured batch: move it to "In progress",
implement it, open a pull request, and move the issue to "In review".
~ remaining -= 1
while {remaining > 0} [Pick up the next captured issue] -> work_issue
else [Batch flushed] -> refresh_queue

=== refresh_queue ===
Count the ready issues once, after the captured batch has been flushed.
? remaining
while {remaining > 0} [A new batch is ready] -> work_issue
else [Queue is clear] -> share_update

=== share_update ===
Post a short status update with links to the open pull requests.
-> END
